{"id":70639,"date":"2026-10-24T08:57:44","date_gmt":"2026-10-24T07:57:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70639"},"modified":"2026-10-24T08:59:19","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T07:59:19","slug":"corta-mato-do-montemuro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corta-mato-do-montemuro\/","title":{"rendered":"7\u00ba Corta Mato do Montemuro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">7\u00ba Corta Mato do Montemuro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>7\u00ba Corta Mato do Montemuro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na tarde de s\u00e1bado, <strong>7 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, nos terrenos anexos ao emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Santu\u00e1rio de Nossa Senhora da Ouvida<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Monteiras<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Castro Daire<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>). Integrada como 9\u00aa jornada do circuito municipal <strong>(Per)Correr Castro Daire 2026<\/strong>, a prova decorre em simult\u00e2neo com o <strong>62\u00ba Campeonato Distrital de Corta-Mato<\/strong> da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Viseu e com o <strong>Campeonato de Portugal de Cross Longo<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o da imponente <strong>Serra de Montemuro<\/strong>, a mais de mil metros de altitude junto ao miradouro natural da <strong>Senhora da Ouvida<\/strong>, o evento abre \u00e0s <strong>14:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Caminhada &#8220;Rota da Senhora da Ouvida&#8221;<\/strong> (<strong>7 km<\/strong> pelos caminhos rurais de Monteiras). A competi\u00e7\u00e3o de corta-mato arranca \u00e0s <strong>15:00<\/strong> num circuito t\u00e9cnico desenhado em duas voltas padr\u00e3o \u2014 Volta Pequena de 1 km (+18m D+) e Volta Grande de 2 km (+46m D+) \u2014, compreendendo <strong>1 km<\/strong> para Benjamins e Infantis (15:00), <strong>2 km<\/strong> para Iniciados (15:15), <strong>3 km<\/strong> para Juvenis Femininas e <strong>5 km<\/strong> para Juniores, Seniores e Veteranas Femininas (15:35), culminando \u00e0s <strong>16:10<\/strong> com os <strong>4 km<\/strong> de Juvenis Masculinos e os <strong>8 km<\/strong> para Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos Masculinos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castro Daire<\/strong> e pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Viseu<\/strong>, em parceria com a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Monteiras<\/strong> e a <strong>ACDR de Colo de Pito<\/strong>, o evento est\u00e1 aberto a atletas federados e populares, distribuindo pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros da geral masculina e feminina e encerrando com lanche conv\u00edvio e entrega de trof\u00e9us no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Colo de Pito<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Santu\u00e1rio de Nossa Senhora da Ouvida, Monteiras, Castro Daire, Viseu<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: r