tyle=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Solid\u00e1ria (at\u00e9 03\/11\/2026):<\/strong> 2,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 03\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 7\u00ba Corta Mato do Montemuro 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 7\u00ba Corta Mato do Montemuro realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 7 de novembro de 2026, nos terrenos anexos ao Santu\u00e1rio de Nossa Senhora da Ouvida, na freguesia de Monteiras, concelho de Castro Daire (distrito de Viseu). O secretariado abre \u00e0s 14:00, a caminhada parte \u00e0s 14:30 e as provas de corta-mato iniciam-se \u00e0s 15:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e dist\u00e2ncias por escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c0s 14:30 parte a Caminhada de 7 km (tempo limite de 2h30). No Corta-Mato: \u00e0s 15:00 correm Benjamins e Infantis M\/F (1 km); \u00e0s 15:15 Iniciados M\/F (2 km); \u00e0s 15:35 Juvenis F (3 km) e Juniores, Seniores e Veteranas F (5 km); e \u00e0s 16:10 Juvenis M (4 km) e Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos M (8 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o e o prazo limite de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00eam um valor simb\u00f3lico de 2,00 \u20ac (que reverte diretamente para a associa\u00e7\u00e3o parceira local) e devem ser formalizadas online at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de ter\u00e7a-feira, 3 de novembro de 2026. N\u00e3o s\u00e3o aceites inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no dia da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que pr\u00e9mios individuais e coletivos s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral individual (masculina e feminina) s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos medalh\u00f5es aos 3 primeiros e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros (1\u00ba: 100 \u20ac, 2\u00ba: 70 \u20ac, 3\u00ba: 50 \u20ac, 4\u00ba: 40 \u20ac, 5\u00ba: 30 \u20ac). H\u00e1 ainda medalh\u00f5es para o top 3 de cada escal\u00e3o\/g\u00e9nero e trof\u00e9us para as 5 primeiras equipas na classifica\u00e7\u00e3o coletiva. A entrega de pr\u00e9mios e o lanche conv\u00edvio decorrem no Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Colo de Pito.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis balne\u00e1rios e quem organiza a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Al\u00e9m das infraestruturas locais, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza os balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio Municipal de Castro Daire (a 6,5 km do Santu\u00e1rio da Senhora da Ouvida) entre as 13:30 e as 18:30. O evento \u00e9 organizado pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castro Daire e pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Viseu, em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a Junta de Freguesia de Monteiras e a ACDR de Colo de Pito.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"7\u00ba Corta Mato do Montemuro 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Santu\u00e1rio de Nossa Senhora 